                <pb facs="1115" n="1623" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1623"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Mr. Jessup addressed the First Committee on November 23 concerning the British
                    draft resolution of November 18, broadening the scope of the amendments proposed
                    on November 17 by Secretary Marshall in Delga
                    797, <ref target="#pg1603">page 1603</ref>; for the full text of his statement,
                    see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, December 5, 1948,
                    page 687. The official text of the United States amendments to the British draft
                    resolution is printed in GA, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">3rd sess., Pt. I, First Committee, Annexes</hi>, page
                    66. The United States amendments were revised on November 25; for text, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, page 67.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
